Service logos
-------------
Brand icons are taken from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org, https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons),
released under CC0 1.0 Universal. Only the icons used by presets are bundled offline in
src/lib/logos.generated.js (generated by scripts/gen-logos.mjs).

All product names, logos, brands and trademarks shown in this app (Netflix, Spotify, YouTube, Apple,
Yandex, Kinopoisk, VK, Telegram, OpenAI/ChatGPT, Anthropic/Claude, Google and others) are the property
of their respective owners. Their use here is only for identifying the services and does not imply
endorsement or affiliation. Some Simple Icons may be subject to brand guidelines of their owners.
Services without an icon in Simple Icons are shown as a colored badge with an initial.

Preset prices are approximate list prices and may differ by country, plan and date.

Exchange rates
--------------
Rates are fetched from the free, keyless https://open.er-api.com service (ExchangeRate-API), with
cached and built-in approximate fallbacks.
